fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"play/gstplay.html#gst_play_message_parse_warning_missing_plugin","fragment":"\n\tgst_play_message_parse_warning_missing_plugin\n\n\n\tGstPlay.PlayMessage.prototype.parse_warning_missing_plugin\n\n\n\tGstPlay.PlayMessage.parse_warning_missing_plugin\n\nParses missing plugin descriptions and installer details from a\nGST_PLAY_ERROR_MISSING_PLUGIN warning message.\nBoth arrays will have the same length, and strings at the same index\ncorrespond to each other.\nThe installer details can be passed to gst_install_plugins_sync or\ngst_install_plugins_async.\nParameters:\nA GstMessage\na NULL-terminated array of descriptions\na NULL-terminated array of installer details\nTRUE if the message contained a missing-plugin error.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nParses missing plugin descriptions and installer details from a\nGST_PLAY_ERROR_MISSING_PLUGIN warning message.\nBoth arrays will have the same length, and strings at the same index\ncorrespond to each other.\nThe installer details can be passed to GstPbutils.prototype.install_plugins_sync or\nGstPbutils.prototype.install_plugins_async.\nParameters:\nA Gst.Message\nReturns a tuple made of:\ntrue if the message contained a missing-plugin error.\ntrue if the message contained a missing-plugin error.\ntrue if the message contained a missing-plugin error.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nParses missing plugin descriptions and installer details from a\nGST_PLAY_ERROR_MISSING_PLUGIN warning message.\nBoth arrays will have the same length, and strings at the same index\ncorrespond to each other.\nThe installer details can be passed to GstPbutils.install_plugins_sync or\nGstPbutils.install_plugins_async.\nParameters:\nA Gst.Message\nReturns a tuple made of:\nTrue if the message contained a missing-plugin error.\nTrue if the message contained a missing-plugin error.\nTrue if the message contained a missing-plugin error.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});